# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# ---- deliberately NOT published -------------------------------------------
# Visual reference images collected while designing. They are other people's
# artwork; republishing them on a PUBLIC repo is a copyright exposure with no
# upside, and the game does not read them. Kept locally, just not pushed.
inspo/

# The impeccable design skill is a third-party package (Apache 2.0). It is
# ~3.3MB of vendored code that anyone can restore in one command:
#     npx --yes impeccable install
# Committing a copy of someone else's package bloats the clone and adds a
# second copy to keep in step. The HOOK CONFIG below is kept, so a fresh clone
# still knows the project expects the skill (HANDOFF-V2 §3).
.claude/skills/

# Personal Claude Code settings (machine-specific paths, not project config).
.claude/settings.json

# ---- everything else IS source --------------------------------------------
# No build step and no dependencies by design (HANDOFF-V2 §2), so js/, css/,
# music/, the test suites and the docs are all source and all belong here.
